// Field Guide tooltip dictionary: {key, text}. Keys are widget labels as
// ux::label_key() spells them ("Grid##tb" -> "Grid", "##st" -> "#st").
// Lookup order for a widget: "<scope>/<key>" (Toolbar2D, Inspector3D ...),
// "<section>/<key>" (the component header above it), "<key>", then
// "<section>/*". Menu items use "Menu/<label>"; component headers
// "Header/<label>". --smoke-ux fails when a toolbar or Inspector widget has
// no line here, so a new field only needs one entry. Australian English;
// say what it does, then the units.

// ---- 2D toolbar -------------------------------------------------------------
